 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nTalleres Mediterráneo SA                                      MASTER SERVICES\nAvenida Diagonal 220, 46001 Valencia, Spain                            AGREEMENT\nCIF/NIF: ESB92313321\nReg No: ES-449569\n\nFROM\n\nTalleres Mediterráneo SA                                      FACTURAR A\nAvenida Diagonal 220                                          Suministros del Norte SL\n46001 Valencia                                                Calle Mayor 15\nSpain                                                         46001 Valencia\nVAT: ESB92313321                                              Spain\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 15/05/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Talleres Mediterráneo SA, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220,\nValencia (\"Party A\"), and Suministros del Norte SL, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15,\nValencia (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Talleres Mediterráneo SA / Lucía Fernández\n Party B   Suministros del Norte SL / Lucía Fernández\n Date      15/05/2026",
